# Build context for apps/hypersweeper/Dockerfile.e2e. The context is the repo
# root because the npm workspace is rooted there (package.json, the one
# package-lock.json, the hoisted node_modules) — but the *image* copies only the
# manifests below; everything else arrives at run time through the bind mount in
# apps/hypersweeper/docker-compose.e2e.yml. So the context can be almost empty,
# which matters: .git and node_modules are hundreds of megabytes between them.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!apps/hypersweeper/package.json
!apps/reptiles/package.json
